<#b478ff>REGENERATION / DESPAIR</>
  X changes after her first lost round.
Regeneration (hold, until she loses a round)		^X
  Turns meter into life, but only heals back her red
  (recoverable) life. She can be hit the whole time.
  The bottom gauge shows how much red life is left.
<#b478ff>DESPAIR GAUGE</>
  After she loses a round, X becomes the Despair gauge
  for the rest of the match. Every round after that
  starts 10% full. It fills when she takes damage, and
  a little when she blocks.
Despair (full gauge)		^X
  Dark form for 12 seconds: +25% damage and the
  Affettuoso super. Drains about 10% of her life
  (it cannot KO her). The gauge empties after.

<#b478ff>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab (also in the air)		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on her passes 15% of her life.
Dash / Back Step		_F_F / _B_B
Air Dash / Air Back Dash (air)		_F_F / _B_B
Double Jump (air)		_U
Super Jump		_D_U

<#b478ff>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
  Chains: Light into Medium into Heavy, standing into
  crouching. Jump cancel on hit.
Water-Skim Slash		_F^B
Sea Split		_F^C
Rising Slash		_DF^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Matagi Shooting Sword (air)		_D^C

<#b478ff>SPECIALS</>
Oratorio (also in the air)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Scherzo		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Aero Dive (after a Super Jump)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C

<#b478ff>SUPERS</>
Sforzando (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Tempestoso (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
Affettuoso (1 bar, Despair only)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
  Counter super. Replaces Tempestoso during Despair.
Arioso (1 bar)		_D_D^A_+^B
Grandioso (3 bars, ground or air)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
